{"ID":"20240513083313-8br8oxn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083313-8br8oxn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083313-8br8oxn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114645-2xf6ahl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114645-2xf6ahl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:262,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513114645-2xf6ahl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:635,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:635\u0026#125;","title":"097","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123446"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513114645-2xf6ahl","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 962px;","id":"20240513114645-2xf6ahl","updated":"20240515123446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"079-4 L, E"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Female"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"66歲 中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/04/23"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺癌四期。右脅如有一物在內，不痛（彎腰時感覺到，向右側躺會呼吸困難"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→水停胸膜腔，半夏甘遂湯證"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳嗽多（早晨重），但無痰出，自覺很多痰在其中。睡眠好轉，在3:00AM仍時醒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一直餓（一年前無胃口），體重一直下降中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→體重下降是因為脾強了且改吃好的食物"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有，喜冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以前身一直冷，現在較溫了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"時一日一到四次，時見清榖，有時成形"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手足："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠好轉，在3:00AM仍時醒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"汗："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無盜汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡時身熱："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夜里只蓋下半身，上身不蓋，但并無熱燥現象"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右寸脈附骨"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡白有裂紋"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎反應差，肝區好，原右眼肺區深青色一塊已退去"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺寒，治肺實肝  健脾"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1. 甘遂1，半夏1，白芍1，甘草1"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→半夏甘遂湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7粒         "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中餐后用蜜一湯匙沖水送服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 紫參四錢 炙甘草四錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→紫參甘草湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏四錢 南星三錢 桔梗一兩"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→去痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乾薑二錢 五味子三錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→溫肺止咳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢 玉金五錢 青皮二錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→治肺先治肝，可防止病再進"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生薑二片"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→強心"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9—3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早餐前及晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"說明："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 治肺癌時要護肝，病人胃口一直很好，表示肝很好，沒有克到土"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 病人有些擔心，憂傷肺，醫囑要病人開心，多關心外面的事情"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 病人的心臟力量弱，故常感身冷，但仍製造奶水，故奶水逆流"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 因為肺中水是寒的，故水下沉，故積水，病人咳不出。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}